NOTE ON THE DATASETS

This license covers the code in this repository (the notebooks). It does not
grant rights to the accompanying data files, which are derived from
third-party sources that carry their own terms:

  - FINAL_FILTERED_CRISPR_DATA.csv
  - SupplementaryTable1.xlsx

These are derived from the supplementary data of Doench et al. (2016),
Nature Biotechnology 34(2), https://doi.org/10.1038/nbt.3437, together with
the DepMap portal (https://depmap.org) and the GeCKOv1 library. Please consult
and cite those sources directly for any reuse of the data.
